SQLarius: You made it. This is the Rootyard — empty most days now, it used to be full of knowledge seekers before the hackers came.
SQLarius: We have 4 Buildings here. P-Building, L-Building, M-Building, and lastly where the hackers are hiding the D-Building.
SQLarius: We need to get the keys from the first three building, when you get the [color=blue]The Blue Key [/color] from the P-Building after completing an SQL Injection challenge.
SQLarius: After that you be able to the L-Building. And from there is another challenge then you will get the [color=red]Red Key[/color].
SQLarius: And lastly you will go to the M-Building and get the [color=gold]Gold Key[/color].
SQLarius: After you collect all of them, you will be able to enter the D-Building where they have my powers stored. And we will take them back.
[signal arg="move"]